# Measurement evidence — screenshots, session recordings, benchmark reports.
# Kept outside the repo (see docs/EVIDENCE.md): it is how we verified our own
# numbers, not something a consumer of this repo needs, and it is tens of MB of
# media. `./deploy.sh bench` writes here, so this also stops a benchmark run
# quietly re-committing it.
docs/evidence/

# Internal meeting notes — never publish
.meeting_summary/
